OL,3,GNEWSAFestival to host tribute to
OL,4,Ainfluential photographer
OL,5,
OL,6,FA temporary free public gallery is set
OL,7,Fto host a tribute to one of Britain's
OL,8,Fmost influential photographers, as part
OL,9,Fof a city-wide photography festival.
OL,11,FCommon Sense, a tribute to late
OL,12,Fphotographer Martin Parr, will be among
OL,13,Fseveral exhibitions at Bristol Photo
OL,14,FFestival to be held in a hub at the
OL,15,FWelcome Building in Bristol's business
OL,16,Fdistrict.
OL,18,FFestival organisers say the idea is a
OL,19,Fway of bringing business and creative
OL,20,Fcommunities together.
OL,23,APub: 12-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
