OL,3,GNEWSAFestival to host tribute to
OL,4,Ainfluential photographer
OL,5,
OL,6,FParr, whose colourful images captured
OL,7,FBritish life, died at the age of 73 at
OL,8,Fhome in Bristol in December. The
OL,9,Fgallery will be open from 15 to 18
OL,10,FOctober from 12:00 to 18:00 GMT and
OL,11,Fwill host five exhibitions.
